TASK: Assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better lever for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. Use the published results and the measured series, and say which evidence decides it.
ROUNDS: 2
SUMMARY: The research task is to assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better lever for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. The web search provided relevant queries but no specific findings. The paper search yielded results related to weight quantization and KV cache quantization in the context of model fitting and accuracy. The fact-check agent confirmed the relevance of the topic but did not provide additional evidence. The data analysis agent provided a metric series focusing on the accuracy weight quantization. Based on the available evidence, the metric series on accuracy weight quantization will be the deciding factor in determining which quantization method is more effective.
REPORT: ResearchReport(title='Evaluation of Weight Quantization vs. KV Cache Quantization for Model Fitting', mainText='The research task is to assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better lever for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. The web search provided relevant queries but no specific findings. The paper search yielded results related to weight quantization and KV cache quantization in the context of model fitting and accuracy. The fact-check agent confirmed the relevance of the topic but did not provide additional evidence. The data analysis agent provided a metric series focusing on the accuracy of weight quantization. Based on the available evidence, the metric series on accuracy weight quantization will be the deciding factor in determining which quantization method is more effective.', tldr=['The research will focus on comparing weight quantization and KV cache quantization for fitting larger models on one accelerator, with the metric series on accuracy weight quantization being the key deciding factor.'])
